      "signpost": "an unstated amount",
      "definition": "an amount or number of something, not stated exactly, often part of a larger amount already mentioned",
      "explanation": "**Some** stands alone, without a following noun, when the thing it refers to is already clear from what was just said: *I need money — do you have some?* It is often followed by **of**: *some of the cake*.",
